    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">15 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip ok\">Easy</span><span class=\"chip accent\">1-D DP</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Fibonacci</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/climbing-stairs/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 70</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Climbing Stairs</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Split every climb by its last move: it came from step n-1 or from step n-2, and those groups never overlap, so ways(n) = ways(n-1) + ways(n-2) with ways(0) = ways(1) = 1. Two rolling variables: O(n) time, O(1) space.</p>\n"
